          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\">Meet, share experiences, and make sense together. Find EuroSense events and opportunities to connect with our community. Everyone is welcome, and we encourage you to join whatever your experience with the topic.</p></div>",
