        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Monday, 16 November 2026<br>18:30–20:00 CET · Online · Free</strong></p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": { "area": "18/2/21/10", "zIndex": 4, "justify": "flex-start", "align": "flex-start" },
            "desktop": { "area": "18/3/20/12", "zIndex": 4, "justify": "flex-start", "align": "flex-start" }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Meet other EuroSense participants, share project updates and challenges, and explore how citizen stories can inform policy. The session features a <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DFE0KtHWFZoXA6fs2jLT4i_s4-blgSOM/view?usp=drive_link\">Policy Brief on AI and society</a>. It builds on the stories we collected and a few <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15MoDh5yhqWaVdegjLebKenXC_80RVVHZ/view?usp=drive_link\">collective sensemaking sessions</a> we ran over the past few months. Additionally, we’ll share reflections from the Futures4Europe conference, and we welcome everyone to share your own news and updates.</p></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": { "area": "21/2/27/10", "zIndex": 5, "justify": "flex-start", "align": "flex-start" },
            "desktop": { "area": "20/3/26/12", "zIndex": 5, "justify": "flex-start", "align": "flex-start" }
          }
