        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Share your experience of housing and discuss what those stories mean and what we can do next. The session connects to the European Citizens’ Initiative <a href=\"https://right-to-housing.eu/\">Right to Housing! Now and Forever</a>, calling for affordable, sustainable and fair housing across Europe. You can <a href=\"https://collector.sensemaker-suite.com/collector?projectID=d1c06283-3a51-4050-ac6d-ea29ae75f32c&amp;ID=EGF_housing\">share your housing story</a> beforehand.</p></div>",
